<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Burned-out creep.-->
  <VFEI2_BurnedCreep.description>烧坏的蠕变。</VFEI2_BurnedCreep.description>
  <!--EN: burned creep-->
  <VFEI2_BurnedCreep.label>烧伤蠕变</VFEI2_BurnedCreep.label>
  <!--EN: Burned-out jellyfloor.-->
  <VFEI2_BurnedJellyFloor.description>烧坏的果冻地板。</VFEI2_BurnedJellyFloor.description>
  <!--EN: burned jellyfloor-->
  <VFEI2_BurnedJellyFloor.label>烧焦的果冻地板</VFEI2_BurnedJellyFloor.label>
  <!--EN: A unique form of cracked soil, devoid of any minerals and nutrition, created around the insectoid infested areas. Supports insectoid structures and significantly hinders non-insectoid movement.-->
  <VFEI2_Creep.description>一种独特形式的开裂土壤，缺乏任何矿物质和营养，是在类昆虫出没的地区周围形成的。支持昆虫结构并显着阻碍非昆虫运动。</VFEI2_Creep.description>
  <!--EN: creep-->
  <VFEI2_Creep.label>蠕变</VFEI2_Creep.label>
  <!--EN: A special form of gellatinous floor, which sprouts from the creep in insectoid hives. Supports insectoid structures and significantly hinders non-insectoid movement. It’s much less flammable than the creep, and it’s significantly easier to clean.-->
  <VFEI2_JellyFloor.description>一种特殊形式的胶状地板，从类昆虫蜂巢中的蠕虫中发芽。支持昆虫结构并显着阻碍非昆虫运动。它比蠕变材料不易燃，而且更容易清洁。</VFEI2_JellyFloor.description>
  <!--EN: jellyfloor-->
  <VFEI2_JellyFloor.label>果冻地板</VFEI2_JellyFloor.label>
  <!--EN: A special form of gellatinous floor consisting of royal jelly, which is created as a result of enriching jellyfloors. Supports insectoid structures and significantly hinders non-insectoid movement. Unlike creep, it’s not flammable, and does not collect animal filth.-->
  <VFEI2_RoyalJellyFloor.description>一种特殊形式的凝胶状底层，由蜂王浆组成，是通过丰富果冻底层而产生的。支持昆虫结构并显着阻碍非昆虫运动。与蠕变不同，它不易燃，并且不会收集动物粪便。</VFEI2_RoyalJellyFloor.description>
  <!--EN: royal jellyfloor-->
  <VFEI2_RoyalJellyFloor.label>蜂王浆地板</VFEI2_RoyalJellyFloor.label>
</LanguageData>
